Subject: [hermes-core-seam] Bound child capabilities and session controls

Add an operator-controlled child toolset ceiling that intersects the live
parent surface and cannot implicitly regain MCP or role-granted capabilities.
Allow status and interrupt RPCs to use exact live session ownership while
preserving the no-session TUI helper contract.

Upstream base: 3c5fd918e3e2537cd74f4f88c990c5de5cbd9f63

